OL,3,GNEWSABBC radio station sets
OL,4,Ahalf-marathon world record
OL,5,
OL,6,FA BBC radio producer has officially
OL,7,Fbecome a Guinness World Record holder
OL,8,Fafter running a half marathon while
OL,9,Fpresenting a live radio show.
OL,11,FTim Boswell, BBC Hereford & Worcester's
OL,12,Fexecutive producer, completed the
OL,13,FWorcester City Half Marathon course in
OL,14,Fa little over two hours and 20 minutes
OL,15,Fon 13 September.
OL,17,FThe attempt, which was set as a
OL,18,Fchallenge by British Olympic silver
OL,19,Fmedallist Steve Cram, has now been
OL,20,Fverified by Guinness World Records.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
